# code outside a class can't add an attribute to an object (Q-019h, Q-031k, D-096)
** spec: syntax/declarations.md#classes-and-objects
driver c14_attribute_outside is
  process main is
    new p := {x: 1, y: 2};
    new p.z := 7;                ** compile error: it would break the encapsulation
  return;
end c14_attribute_outside;
